        "title": "Fix fleet watcher rearm redraw loop",
        "body": "Closes #1\r\n\r\n## Summary\r\n\r\nFixes the fleet file watcher retry path so missing `~/.config/nameplate/fleet.json` does not trigger unnecessary settings publishes every 15 seconds.\r\n\r\n`FleetFileWatcher.arm()` now reports whether it successfully installed a file-system watcher. The rearm timer only calls `onChange()` when rearming succeeds, preserving later fleet file creation detection without causing repeated menu bar redraws or overlay visibility checks while the file is absent.\r\n\r\n## Verification\r\n\r\n- `swift build`\r\n- `git diff --check`\r\n",
